  <div class="highlight">
    <strong>Daily Executive Summary:</strong> During today's sprint (10:30 AM – 7:30 PM IST), critical enterprise deliverables were achieved:
    <strong>Meta WhatsApp Cloud API Live Dispatch & Database Decoupling Fix (100%)</strong>, 
    <strong>Complete Frontend VoIP UI Removal across all 16 components per client instructions (100%)</strong>, 
    <strong>Workqueue Production Zoho Parity & Brand Harmonization (100%)</strong>, and 
