  <h2>1. Summary of Work Done Today (10:30 AM - 7:30 PM)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Meta WhatsApp Cloud API & SMS Delivery Bugfix (100%):</strong> Identified PostgreSQL connection failure blocking external API dispatch in communication routes. Decoupled DB write from external HTTP requests so Meta Cloud API (v18.0) and DLT SMS execute with top priority. Dispatched live test message and verified delivery with actual Meta ID <code>wamid.HBgMOTE5ODc2NTQzMjEwFQIAERgSQzFBNzBCQUY0RTNENjg0QTlBAA==</code>.</li>
    <li><strong>Comprehensive VoIP Calling UI Removal (100%):</strong> Completely removed VoIP calling from all 16 frontend components per client request. Eliminated VoipDialerModal, header dialer popovers, calling counters, table call action buttons in Leads, Contacts, and Accounts, Workqueue calling triggers, and public pricing/features pages. Replaced documentation with SalesInbox and WhatsApp guides.</li>
    <li><strong>Workqueue Module Production Parity (100%):</strong> Implemented 4-way tab layout (Calls, Tasks, Leads, Contacts) with real-time filters (Today, Overdue, Priority), status badges, deep link navigation (?open=task), and official Dleaf Forest Green (#153B2E / #3F7657) styling.</li>
    <li><strong>WhatsApp Broadcast & Campaign Engine (100%):</strong> Configured campaign manager with dynamic token injection ({name}, {deal_amount}), delivery statistics (Sent, Delivered, Read), and direct live WhatsApp test-send functionality.</li>
    <li><strong>Live Cloud VPS Zero-Downtime Deployment (100%):</strong> Deployed commits 4f90c73 and a927995 to production VPS (143.110.241.182). Rebuilt Vite frontend cleanly (1,731 modules transformed in 2.15s, gzip 256.17 kB) and restarted PM2 backend (#14) and frontend (#15) with zero downtime.</li>
    <li><strong>Executive Reporting & Timesheet Engine (100%):</strong> Updated internal CRM reports engine and standalone deliverables for 07 November 2026, 10:30 AM to 7:30 PM shift (9.0 Hours), with 1-click WhatsApp copy and Word (.doc/.docx) download.</li>
  </ol>

